# Duplicate a note, then merge Pāhoehoe into Lava: M picks the target in the switcher, the preview
# lists the frontmatter and the links that will change, y merges, u undoes the whole merge, and
# the second merge stays. tests/drive.rs checks the files and the trash.
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
keys p
type kilauea
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Kīlauea  reading
keys D
wait-for duplicated as Kīlauea 1 · R rename
wait-for example-workspace 36 notes
expect Volcanoes/Kīlauea 1 › Kīlauea  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys p
type pahoehoe
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Pāhoehoe  reading
keys M
wait-for Merge Pāhoehoe into…
expect ⏎ preview the merge · Esc cancel
type lava
wait-for 2 notes
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Pāhoehoe  into  Concepts/Lava
expect Its text (4 lines) goes at the end of Lava; Pāhoehoe goes to the trash.
expect + tags: lava
expect + aliases: Pāhoehoe, so searching for it still finds Lava
expect 4 links in 4 files will lead to Lava:
expect ▤ Volcanoes/Kīlauea 1  1 link
expect 9  by the Hawaiian [[Hotspot]], and its lava flows are mostly [[Lava]] and [[ʻAʻā]].
expect ▤ Concepts/Lava  1 link
expect u undoes the whole merge.
screen
keys n
wait-for merge cancelled
expect Concepts/Pāhoehoe  reader
keys M
wait-for Merge Pāhoehoe into…
type lava
wait-for 2 notes
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Pāhoehoe  into  Concepts/Lava
keys y
wait-for merged Pāhoehoe into Lava · 4 links now lead there · u undo
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
expect Concepts/Lava  reading
expect-not • Pāhoehoe
keys u
wait-for merge undone: Concepts/Pāhoehoe.md is back and Concepts/Lava.md is as it was
wait-for example-workspace 36 notes
expect Concepts/Pāhoehoe  reading
keys M
wait-for Merge Pāhoehoe into…
type lava
wait-for 2 notes
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Pāhoehoe  into  Concepts/Lava
keys enter
wait-for merged Pāhoehoe into Lava · 4 links now lead there · u undo
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
keys esc
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
